YTALEXA - VERSION AND FEATURE LOG
=================================

Hindi voice search for YouTube audio on Amazon Echo, served from an
always-on Android phone over Termux. No YouTube Data API. Uses the
owner's YouTube Premium cookies for PO-token exemption.

Build rule: one feature per step. Nothing is marked DONE until it
runs and has been checked by hand.


